						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1377.msg13712#msg13712"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/question.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1377.msg13712#msg13712">Still Play?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b> on:</b> January 16, 2005, 09:09:14 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Just curious, not attempting to start a flame war, and this more than likely seems a little redundant; especially with all &quot;Dead EQ&quot; topics.<br />I still play..My guild (Dragons of Exile) has about 50-100 active members still. Idk, but estimating on the Bazaar ratio from having 500+ to now around 250 on a good day, I think that there is little more than 40% of the people left.&nbsp; But some guys on the server were talking about &#039;Server Merges&#039; which I&#039;m really hoping we get, because it would be....really cool
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
