	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg13714"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=917" title="View the profile of EshetheShammy">EshetheShammy</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Guild Officer<br />
								Splitpaw Gnoll<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Female.gif" alt="Female" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 72<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/boobies.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								I know you wanna look<br />
								<br />
								
								
								<a href="http://edit.yahoo.com/config/send_webmesg?.target=Messhaller"><img src="http://opi.yahoo.com/online?u=Messhaller&amp;m=g&amp;t=0" alt="Messhaller" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="aim:goim?screenname=Messhaller&amp;message=Hi.+Are+you+there?"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/aim.gif" alt="Messhaller" border="0" /></a><br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=917"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:Messhaller@aol.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1377.msg13714#msg13714"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1377.msg13714#msg13714">Re: Still Play?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #1 on:</b> January 16, 2005, 09:50:17 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Some of the old guilds died but there are alot of old &quot;new ones&quot; poping up League of Sozobon is one of them they consistantly have 25-30 people on during the afternoon and evenings.&nbsp; They are working on elemental flaging atm.&nbsp; &nbsp;Also conviction is still going strong and EiE for those that are wanting the high end game again.&nbsp; I think this is good for the game honnestly some different people to play with and guilds that actually want to do something other than just exist.&nbsp; Which I think there are less of now.&nbsp; In my oppinion they should take the ideas they had for EQ2 and stick them in EQ1 that would bring people back that went over there.&nbsp; And I am starting to see that with the new expansion and the Guild Halls they are starting up.&nbsp; Ok that&#039;s my story and Im stickin to it! LOL<br /><br />Eshebala
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
