									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #4 on:</b> January 16, 2005, 05:36:39 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Bazaar population has been peaking at over 300 late at night again. I would assume the people who went away and decided to come back have mostly done so. So, no more 500+ bazaar nights, but I have yet to see a late night in bazaar below 280ish, and mostly over 300.
						</td>
					</tr>
