								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 44<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/austin.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								An Everquest Player on Rodcet Nife<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=516"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1377.msg13737#msg13737"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1377.msg13737#msg13737">Re: Still Play?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #9 on:</b> January 17, 2005, 06:12:14 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							RN is still relativly strong but eventually we will need server mergers to continue the game its going to die down eventually due to the lack of new player influx but it will still be some time before that occurs and RN is likely to remain strong for a good while yet.We have 2 guilds Qvic enabled and one more real close to it .. EIE/DA counts as one on that score =P . One Anguish guild and Ascent real close to being enabled as well . I dont suspect Conviction to stay far behind on that score as they have alot of drive and are gearing up at an amazing rate.<br />I is starting to get old with the whole EQ is dead theme that the folks who left are spewing on these boards but you really cant expect much more considering who owns them ..&nbsp; The game will live on for a good long while yet if your not playing EQ anymore hope your having fun elsewhere but please for the rest of us who still enjoy the game take the anti EQ bullshit to the forums that support it .. 
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
