							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							One thing to note as well...even if we aren&#039;t merged with another server (which I sincerely hope we are not), there are new faces on RN all the time. People know we&#039;re one of the highest population servers and people are getting transfered to here. I don&#039;t know how common this is but I&#039;ve met a few people now who are transfers.<br /><br />This may just be misinformation I&#039;ve heard from other people as I haven&#039;t been here since the server started, but I&#039;ve been told we are the oldest server to never have a split and in the top 5 for population.
